notes.content:
Hello adventurers!

Hope you all are doing well. Our game [b]A Tale of Silent Depths[/b] will have a demo released by January 17th!

If you don't know A Tale of Silent Depths yet, this is a turn-based tactical RPG with roguelike elements, set in a post-apocalyptic underwater world, where you are invited to lead a society aboard a massive submarine, known as an "Ark". Navigate a vast, procedurally generated ocean teeming with sea creatures, pirates, and other formidable adversaries. With a focus on exploration, resource collection, strategic combat and crafting, you are free to choose your path in the Ocean.

How about we go over the demo?

The demo contains enough content to quite some runs! It will include:
[list]
[*] Approximately 20 unique enemies;
[*] About 15 handcrafted structures and places integrated into the procedural generation;
[*] Almost a 100 items for collecting and crafting, including weapons, drones and others;
[*] About 15 upgrades for you to create your Ark build;
[*] 2 powerful bosses to test your skills;
[*] The start of the storyline of one main character, Captain Jaime Wett, the leader of the Vallius.
[/list]

The full game will build a lot over these features, so be sure to follow us on social media and keep yourself updated!

[url=https://discord.gg/KwhgUX8BUh]Join our Discord![/url]

We are very eager for all of you to play it and send your feedbacks! Cheers!
